  m_Name: E-Fire-Class-Trafo-HoverInfo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Woi.UI.Announcements::Woi.UI.Announcements.LocalizedHoverInfoDefinition
  english:
    title: 'Sprinkler System '
    message: Sprinkler heads contain a heat-sensitive glass bulb that breaks when
      the ambient temperature reaches a certain level. Once the bulb breaks, the
      system is activated and water begins to flow. The water is distributed over
      a wide area through the sprinkler head, helping to control and limit the spread
      of the fire. Only the sprinkler closest to the fire is activated, not the entire
      system.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c733c2fba3a139f4288059c089df3652, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: "Sprinkler-Ya\u011Fmurlama Sistemi "
    message: "Sprinkler ba\u015Fl\u0131klar\u0131nda bulunan \u0131s\u0131ya duyarl\u0131
      cam ampul, ortam s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011F\u0131 belirli bir seviyeye ula\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
      k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. Ampul k\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda sistem
      devreye girer ve su ak\u0131\u015F\u0131 ba\u015Flar. Su, sprinkler ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan
      geni\u015F bir alana yay\u0131larak yang\u0131n\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCmesini engeller.
      Sadece yang\u0131n\u0131n oldu\u011Fu b\xF6lgedeki sprinkler \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r."
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5d324cd949cb4da448a077c0d0d9f8b9, type: 2}
